- **Used only by `{kind}`** (or only by untriaged kinds you change together): move `type <Struct> struct` into `{kind_lowercase}_types.go` under its original name and edit it there. Don't move unmodified parent structs; the generator keeps them in `types.generated.go` and points them at your copy.
