`authoritative-proto-reference` means the proto field has a `google.api.resource_reference`; it is then the only finding for that field. Without one, a field can carry 2–3 heuristic `possible-reference-*` entries. Read all their `detail:` lines together with the proto field comment.

- **The field references a GCP resource:**
