  2. Replace the `*string` / `[]string` with `<fieldName>Ref *<TargetKind>Ref`, or `[]<TargetKind>Ref` for lists (singular field name plus `Refs`, e.g. `datasets` → `DatasetRefs` with `json:"datasetRefs,omitempty"`). Keep `// +kcc:proto:field=...`.
